Third-party notices

This extension is an unofficial, community-maintained tool. It is not
affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Valve Corporation.

Counter-Strike, Source 2, Panorama and the Counter-Strike logo are trademarks
and/or registered trademarks of Valve Corporation. The extension icon is
derived from the Counter-Strike 2 application icon and remains the property of
Valve Corporation; it is used here solely to identify the game this tool
targets.

`data/panels.json` is derived from the schema that Counter-Strike 2 itself
emits via `panorama_generate_layout_xsd`. It contains panel type names,
attribute names and 14 verbatim attribute descriptions authored by Valve.
No Valve source code, art or packed game content is redistributed in this
repository.
